{"id":"n86771-1-9","stage":3,"title":"호주머니 · 口袋","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86771-1-9-1","ko":"호주머니에 뭐가 들었어? 굉장히 불룩한데.","zh":"你口袋里装了什么？看起来鼓鼓的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"호주머니에","meaning":"口袋","explanation":"호주머니：口袋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"호주머니","audio":"/audio/0fb101c039bc7fc0fa6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86771","senseId":"1","lemma":"호주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"호주머니에","audio":"/audio/12677495a2c870419fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐가","audio":"/audio/2c57e944c5dd1dbd2cf3.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"包含，含有","explanation":"들다：包含，含有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"9","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}},{"text":"굉장히","meaning":"非常","explanation":"굉장히：非常","readings":[{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30882","senseId":"1","lemma":"굉장히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}},{"text":"불룩한데.","meaning":"鼓起来","explanation":"불룩하다：鼓起来；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"불룩하다","audio":"/audio/f0e5f55134fa38f4095d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60234","senseId":"1","lemma":"불룩하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불룩한데","audio":"/audio/02093a9e4384f0564430.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0fb101c039bc7fc0","term":"호주머니","zh":"口袋","audio":"/audio/0fb101c039bc7fc0fa6f.mp3","entryId":"86771","definition":"缝在衣服上，用于装钱或者东西的部分。","pronunciation":["호주머니"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"包含，含有","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"装在里面或组成一部分。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"5ffdea7285118469","term":"굉장히","zh":"非常","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3","entryId":"30882","definition":"很大、很优秀地。","pronunciation":["굉장히","궹장히"]},{"id":"f0e5f55134fa38f4","term":"불룩하다","zh":"鼓起来","audio":"/audio/f0e5f55134fa38f4095d.mp3","entryId":"60234","definition":"物体的表面部分呈胀起来或凸出来的状态。","pronunciation":["불루카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7113130f80791c84e60d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86771-1-9-2","ko":"동전을 계속 넣어 둬서 그래.","zh":"因为一直往里面放硬币的缘故。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동전을","meaning":"硬币","explanation":"동전：硬币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동전","audio":"/audio/cde4842b8ab41342df40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48655","senseId":"1","lemma":"동전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동전을","audio":"/audio/b2d2e99da035a6a41ab1.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣어","audio":"/audio/5917140fe7e2cfbda3f8.mp3"}},{"text":"둬서","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","s